<ProjectLayout frontmatter={frontmatter}>
  <h2>Overview</h2>
  <p>
    The Kids Story Generator is an agentic AI pipeline that transforms simple
    prompts into fully-illustrated children's stories. It uses Google's Agent
    Development Kit (ADK) to orchestrate multiple specialized agents:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Story Weaver</strong> — Generates narrative arcs, characters, and plot
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Illustration Engine</strong> — Creates scene descriptions and prompts
      for image generation
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Formatting Agent</strong> — Composes the final output with proper layout
      and styling
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Review Agent</strong> — Ensures age-appropriate content and narrative
      coherence
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Architecture</h3>
  <pre><code>User Prompt
    |
    v
[Story Weaver] ---- generates narrative ----> [Review Agent]
    |                                                |
    v                                                v
[Illustration Engine]                       Feedback Loop
    |
    v
[Formatting Agent]
    |
    v
Final Story (MDX + Images)</code></pre>

  <h3>Technical Details</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Framework:</strong> Google ADK (Agent Development Kit)</li>
    <li>
      <strong>LLM:</strong> Gemini 2.5 Pro (primary), Gemini 2.5 Flash (review agent)
    </li>
    <li><strong>Image Gen:</strong> Gemini-native image generation</li>
    <li><strong>Format:</strong> MDX output with embedded illustrations</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Status</h3>
  <p>
    Active development. Pipeline prototype is functional; working on UI layer
    and story preset system.
  </p>
</ProjectLayout>
